# Page SEO

Every page under [`app/pages/`](mdc:app/pages/) sets SEO in its `<script setup>`. Do not leave a new page with only UI. Copy is Arabic. The document stays `lang="ar"`.

Use [`useDynamicSeo`](mdc:app/composables/useDynamicSeo.js) for the title, description, Open Graph, and Twitter card. It renders during SSR. Add a canonical link from `runtimeConfig.public.siteUrl` plus the current route. Skip the canonical tag when `siteUrl` is empty.

- Static page: plain Arabic title and description, image `/library-logo.png`, `type: "website"`.
- Detail page: title, description, and image from the loaded record (getters or refs). Pass `fallbackImage` when the main image may be a video. Set `type` to `product` or `profile` when that matches the page.
- Title pattern: `صفحة | بكالوريا وثانوية أونلاين`.
- Do not call `useSeoMeta` beside `useDynamicSeo` for the same fields.
- Do not hardcode a production domain. Absolute URLs come from `NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`.
- Do not add another site's Google verification token.

```vue
<script setup>
const config = useRuntimeConfig();
const route = useRoute();

useDynamicSeo({
  title: () => "حجز المنتجات | بكالوريا وثانوية أونلاين",
  description: () => "وصف عربي قصير للصفحة.",
  image: "/library-logo.png",
});

const canonicalUrl = computed(() => {
  const base = config.public.siteUrl || "";
  if (!base) return undefined;
  try {
    return new URL(route.fullPath, base).toString();
  } catch {
    return base;
  }
});

useHead({
  link: computed(() =>
    canonicalUrl.value ? [{ rel: "canonical", href: canonicalUrl.value }] : [],
  ),
});
</script>
```
